1
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,760
Let's split up.

2
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:21,560
Ningning,

3
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,520
you go to the bar.

4
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:23,640
Okay.

5
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:24,800
Be careful.

6
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:25,880
Shi'an,

7
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,039
come with me to the dance floor.

8
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:27,840
Okay.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Are you okay?

10
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,400
You have a murderous look in your eyes.

11
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,930
You don't look like you're here for fun at all.

12
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,920
Do you love me or not?

13
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,880
I love you.

14
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,800
Push me.

15
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,240
You're so pretty, miss.

16
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,240
Name your price.

17
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,760
Be with me tonight.

18
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,800
You brat, how dare you steal my girl?

19
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,720
I think you have a death wish.

20
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,530
Using a gun with your left hand.

21
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,700
Are you stupid?

22
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,480
Zheng Kun,

23
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,040
I have your special dumdum bullets.

24
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,640
You can't escape.

25
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,000
Don't come any closer!

26
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,020
If you come closer, I'll kill her!

27
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,480
If I take you back to the police station,

28
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,940
I'm afraid you won't be able to keep this job.

29
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,880
Please don't.

30
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,280
Officer, you know,

31
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,680
what we dancers fear most is

32
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,480
getting involved with the police.

33
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:33,280
Then I can give you one more chance.

34
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,540
Answer whatever I ask.

35
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,280
Okay.

36
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,320
Do you know that Zheng Kun killed someone?

37
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,360
No, no, no.

38
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,450
I've only known him for a month.

39
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,240
I don't even know what he does.

40
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:48,880
Then what kind of people does he usually contact,

41
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,140
and where does he live?

42
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,400
He would never tell me that.

43
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,680
Usually, whenever we talk about him,

44
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,040
he stops immediately.

45
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:59,000
But he spends money quite generously on me,

46
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,280
so I never cared.

47
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,440
Has he been acting strange lately?

48
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,760
Recently,

49
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,720
he's been really good in bed.

50
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:08,880
Be specific.

51
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,640
He looks strong,

52
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,440
but

53
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,280
he's not very good at that.

54
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,800
He said he got hurt in a fight before.

55
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,120
But

56
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,640
the night before yesterday,

57
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,240
he took a strange pill.

58
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,400
He suddenly became a different person,

59
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,960
extremely excited,

60
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,880
and

61
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,480
he kept going all night.

62
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,530
Do you still have that pill?

63
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,280
No, no, no.

64
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,320
No, no.

65
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,760
I mean,

66
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,440
I need to test that pill.

67
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,220
Just to take a look.

68
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:41,120
When he wants to do that,

69
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,040
he brings it,

70
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,240
and only enough for the day.

71
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,159
He won't let me touch it.

72
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,740
He even threw away the wrapper later.

73
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:52,360
The wrapper of that pill is quite unique.

74
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:55,680
It has a colorful snake on it.

75
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:01,880
Is this it?

76
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,160
Yes, that's it.

77
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,440
Professor Bai, you are well-versed in both Chinese and Western cultures.

78
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:13,700
You must know what this drawing is about.

79
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,810
Snakes represent demons in Western culture.

80
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,210
What about a colorful snake like this?

81
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,560
Is it possible

82
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,980
that it's a symbol?

83
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:24,060
I really don't know what it means.

84
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,120
Give me some time to study it carefully.

85
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:26,680
Okay.

86
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,380
Thank you, Professor Bai.

87
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:35,520
What's wrapped in the colorful banded krait is a special aphrodisiac.

88
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:39,200
The person using the special aphrodisiac actually has special dumdum bullets.

89
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:42,320
I think it looks like a totem.

90
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:45,380
I don't think this pattern has any deep meaning.

91
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,440
Maybe it's just a trademark.

92
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,480
Zheng Kun must have taken some kind of aphrodisiac.

93
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:53,080
And it must be a smuggled banned drug.

94
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,120
As long as we find this drug,

95
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:57,120
we will naturally know everything.

96
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,780
It's a pity Zheng Kun got away.

97
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,600
Inspector Jiang.

98
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:04,640
What?

99
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:07,920
Are these your new underlings?

100
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,840
These are my junior brother and sister.

101
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,240
One is good at chemistry,

102
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,400
and the other is good at kung fu.

103
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,840
I brought them here to learn.

104
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,440
This is Mr. Wang, the forensic doctor.

105
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,370
Hello, Mr. Wang.

106
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,960
You know chemistry?

107
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,520
I study a bit of industrial chemistry.

108
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,600
Just the basics.

109
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,320
Come here.

110
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,250
Come help me take a look.

111
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:26,720
Take a look.

112
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,640
Look at what?

113
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,850
Mr. Wang, stop studying it.

114
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,000
Didn't you say a body

115
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,000
was sent over in the middle of the night?

116
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,440
Yes.

117
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,000
This way.

118
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,159
Here.

119
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:39,280
Come.

120
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,520
Zheng Kun.

121
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,880
Iron Sand Palm.

122
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,880
This is Zheng Kun's autopsy report.

123
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,780
The fatal wound

124
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:53,140
is the Iron Sand Palm strike on his chest.

125
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,520
Nowadays in this city,

126
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,720
there aren't many people who know martial arts.

127
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,800
Who did you think of?

128
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,720
The Jiuhe Gang

129
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,300
started out by practicing martial arts.

130
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,050
Any other discoveries?

131
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,640
In Zheng Kun's blood,

132
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,320
we found ayahuasca.

133
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:08,120
Ayahuasca is a banned drug.

134
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,320
It has severe hallucinogenic effects.

135
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,320
It is not produced

136
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,220
domestically.

137
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,120
Why would it appear here?

138
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,320
It must have been smuggled in.

139
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,050
It's the Jiuhe Gang.

140
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,400
Among a batch of banned drugs we seized last year,

141
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,680
there was ayahuasca.

142
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,920
Then it seems the Jiuhe Gang is a major suspect.

143
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:29,120
Then what role did Zheng Kun play?

144
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,600
He was in charge of transport.

145
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,330
He stole and used some himself.

146
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,600
After we found out, he was silenced.

147
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:37,250
As long as we find out where Zheng Kun went,

148
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,570
we can find this batch of banned drugs.

149
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,720
Then let's split up.

150
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,780
Talcum powder,

151
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,800
coffee beans,

152
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,840
they were all used to cover up the banned drugs,

153
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,320
frame Hengtong Company,

154
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,120
and cause my father's death.

155
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,440
Lei Lie, I won't let you off.

156
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,120
Huo Qishan of the Huo family

157
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,340
pays his respects to Great-Aunt.

158
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:52,610
[Net]

159
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,120
Great-Aunt, are you alright?

160
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,080
I'm fine.

161
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,300
Just a scratch.

162
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,700
Just a scratch.

163
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,000
Did you hear that?

164
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,080
Just a scratch.

165
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,050
Li Chengrui,

166
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,640
our Great-Aunt

167
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:08,320
is the apple of the eye

168
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,720
of everyone in the Huo family.

169
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,250
If anything happens to her,

170
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,720
believe it or not, I'll shoot you.

171
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,120
Yes.

172
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,040
Yes.

173
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,360
Go, go, go.

174
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,500
Good grandson, you came just in time.

175
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:20,400
Tell me nicely,

176
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,960
between the mayor,

177
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,840
the police superintendent,

178
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,500
and you, who is more powerful?

179
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,720
If you put it that way,

180
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,240
it must be the mayor.

181
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,200
But,

182
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,200
he

183
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,700
has no military power,

184
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,600
only administrative power.

185
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,880
When he usually sees me,

186
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,640
he has to respectfully call me

187
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:38,640
Lord Huo.

188
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:39,640
He

189
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:43,720
is just a corrupt official who spends his time drinking and womanizing.

190
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,320
In the Phoenix City area,

191
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,880
the Huo family calls the shots.

192
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,540
Isn't this Great-Aunt

193
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,120
Lord Huo's daughter?

194
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,480
In this Phoenix City,

195
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,920
the Huo family's century-old foundation

196
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:56,600
relies on

197
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,520
their own Taoist sect.

198
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,120
Huo Yining

199
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:04,980
is the leader chosen by the Huo family through divination.

200
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,340
Lord Huo, I want to ask you about someone.

201
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,640
Lei Lie, the leader of the Jiuhe Gang,

202
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,600
do you know him?

203
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,400
I know him,

204
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,040
but we're not close.

205
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,200
It's nothing.

206
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:17,520
I just overturned the Jiuhe Gang's lair a few days ago,

207
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,800
so I'm just asking casually.

208
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,530
You should have overturned it.

209
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,400
Adjutant Zhang has arrived.

210
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:26,240
On behalf of Lord Huo, presenting a Ruyi

211
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:28,680
and a pair of South Sea coral screens.

212
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:29,520
Ruyi,

213
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:31,080
South Sea coral.

214
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,040
Not close.
